  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 72px;\"><strong>重要！此專案將重構為 More Mob Variations + Fresh Animations，除了殭屍之外，還將包含更多生物變體。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3f9f1853338062b065a48609fd0a8b6793ae9422.png\" alt=\"標題\" width=\"900\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<hr />\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">「More Zombie Variations + Fresh Animations」是 Fresh Animations 的附加模組，新增了多種殭屍變體。</p>\n<hr />\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/894c725751d8de9206c7d10a4dc57479e1e91906.png\" alt=\"建議搭配 Fresh Animations\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">本資源包搭配名為 Fresh Animations 的資源包使用，以新增動畫效果。<br /><strong>即使未安裝 Fresh Animations，本資源包仍可作為一般資源包運作，但可能會出現故障或錯誤。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>取得 Fresh Animations</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float: center; margin-right: 10px;\" src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://styles.redditmedia.com/t5_3errm/styles/communityIcon_y1a4gbuv5fea1.png&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" /></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float: center;\" src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67560307?s=200&amp;v=4&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" /> </a></p>\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"included-textures\">包含的紋理</h2>\n<h3 id=\"build-100\">Build 1.0.0</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Steve</li>\n<li>Noor</li>\n<li>Sunny</li>\n<li>Ari</li>\n<li>Zuri</li>\n<li>Makena</li>\n<li>Kai</li>\n<li>Efe</li>\n</ul>",
